			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#5AC85A f=0.8>黄铁矿块</grad></shadow>"
			x: -6.5d
			y: 5.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5EF0A007C1D2E3F4"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>三阶，稀有</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将远古残骸放入</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>切石机</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>中。一块残骸能变成四块原矿，这真的非常划算。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 稀有度是重铸开始回报你的临界点。在稀有度及以上的重铸都会产生星尘，而星尘正是通往巅峰之路。"
			]
			icon: "tiered:galena_chunk"
			id: "5EF0A008C1D2E3F4"
			rewards: [{
				id: "5EF0D008C1D2E3F4"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#6FA8DC to=#6FA8DC>星光开始掉落的地方。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5EF0B008C1D2E3F4"
				item: "tiered:galena_chunk"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>Galena Chunk</grad></shadow>"
			x: -4.0d
			y: 5.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5EF0A008C1D2E3F4"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E696FF to=#B446FF f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>第4阶，史诗级</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这是一个由三种材料组成的垂直列：</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>顶部，一个 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>末影之眼</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 来自 End Remastered 模组</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Middle, an </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>Amethyst Shard</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>底部，</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>凋零生物骨髓</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 来自 Biomancy 模组</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你从中能获得两个查罗石，差不多从这时起，你的运气才开始真正变好。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "tiered:charoite"
			id: "5EF0A009C1D2E3F4"
			rewards: [{
				id: "5EF0D009C1D2E3F4"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#B98FD9 to=#B98FD9>现在我们总算有进展了。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5EF0B009C1D2E3F4"
				item: "tiered:charoite"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#E696FF to=#B446FF f=0.8>Charoite</grad></shadow>"
			x: -1.5d
			y: 5.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5EF0A009C1D2E3F4"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#FFDC50 to=#FFB400 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>第5阶，传说级</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>A </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>Pyrite Chunk</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 位于中央，两个 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>Topaz</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 来自 Terramity 位于左右，两个 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>Khyros Tears</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 来自 Armageddon 位于上下。这样你就能得到两个了。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这是最坚固的材料，而且完全不需要消耗痛苦石，正因如此，你大部分后期装备最终都会用这种材料来强化。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "tiered:crown_topaz"
			id: "5EF0A010C1D2E3F4"
			rewards: [{
				id: "5EF0D010C1D2E3F4"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#E0B84C to=#E0B84C>最棒的那个，不需要花费痛苦石。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5EF0B010C1D2E3F4"
				item: "tiered:crown_topaz"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#FFDC50 to=#FFB400 f=0.8>皇冠托帕石</grad></shadow>"
			x: -1.5d
			y: 7.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5EF0A010C1D2E3F4"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#FF78B4 to=#FF3C3C f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>第6阶，神话级</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>四种末日材料围绕着一个 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>烈焰粉</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 核心排列：</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>顶部，一个 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>血石催化剂</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>左侧，一个 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>Umbral Sun</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>好的，一个 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>垂死之星</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>底部，一个 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>Eclipsium Alloy</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这样你就能得到两个Painite了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"[!danger] 痛苦石是抵达神话的唯一途径。神话装备是唯一能携带星辰的装备，而只有五星级神话装备才能成为巅峰。此任务之后的所有内容都依赖痛苦石运行。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>Painite 也是升级 Salvage Tier 所需的货币，所以别在重roll 时把它们全烧光了。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "tiered:painite"
			id: "5EF0A011C1D2E3F4"
			rewards: [{
				id: "5EF0D011C1D2E3F4"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 25
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.25d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#E06A6A to=#E06A6A>此后的所有内容都需要它。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5EF0B011C1D2E3F4"
				item: "tiered:painite"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#FF78B4 to=#FF3C3C f=0.8>Painite</grad></shadow>"
			x: -4.0d
			y: 7.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5EF0A002C1D2E3F4"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>你正在看的东西</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>重铸完成后，将鼠标悬停在物品上。重铸结果名称会显示在物品名称上方，颜色代表其稀有度，而获得的属性则显示在下方。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>重铸台在窗口旁还显示了一个面板，列出了物品当前携带的卷轴的具体数量，这样你可以在花费任何东西之前进行比较。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>大多数修饰器都有代价</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>普通的骰子会给你一个较大的奖励和较小的惩罚。就像用一点暴击伤害的降低来换取额外的伤害一样。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 请阅读惩罚项，而不仅仅是奖励项。在暴击流中，+30%伤害和-15%暴击伤害是削弱，而在纯伤害流中则是加强。正确的选择完全取决于你的实际玩法。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>有两条路可以离开这个贸易。下一个任务会解释第一条，而</grad><grad from=#C3FAFF to=#8AD8FF f=0.8>完美</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的骰子则负责第二条。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "ftbquests:custom_icon"
				tag: {
					Icon: "cofh_core:textures/gui/icons/icon_information.png"
				}
			}
			id: "5EF0A012C1D2E3F4"
			rewards: [{
				id: "5EF0D012C1D2E3F4"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#9BB7D4 to=#9BB7D4>每个修饰器都有陷阱。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5EF0B012C1D2E3F4"
				title: "我能阅读了"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6>了解你的修饰符</grad></shadow>"
			x: -2.0d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5EF0A012C1D2E3F4"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>没有负面效果的修饰器</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每种稀有度都恰好包含一个完全没有任何负面效果的、</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>纯粹有益的修饰器。它们适用于护甲、近战、远程、工具、盾牌和法杖。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"- <grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#8C8C8C f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>普通，声音</shadow></grad>"
				"- <grad from=#8CFF8C to=#5AC85A f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>不常见，精炼的</shadow></grad>"
				"- <grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>稀有，纯净</shadow></grad>"
				"- <grad from=#E696FF to=#B446FF f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>史诗的，无瑕的</shadow></grad>"
				"- <grad from=#FFDC50 to=#FFB400 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>传奇，无瑕</shadow></grad>"
				"- <grad from=#FF78B4 to=#FF3C3C f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>神话，超凡脱俗</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"[!danger] 这些物品绝不会从战利品中掉落。既非宝箱，也非怪物或首领。重铸台是整个游戏中唯一能找到的地方。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这正是重铸优于野外任何物品的原因。继续重铸，总会出一个的。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[spoiler]盔甲的掉落概率约为3%，武器约为6%，工具和盾牌约为9%至11%。鞘翅和鱼竿没有此概率，因为它们各有两个修饰符，第三个会使概率变为三分之一。"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "ftbquests:custom_icon"
				tag: {
					Icon: "ftblibrary:icons/info_gray"
				}
			}
			id: "5EF0A013C1D2E3F4"
			rewards: [{
				id: "5EF0D013C1D2E3F4"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#9BB7D4 to=#9BB7D4>只能通过重铸获得。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5EF0B013C1D2E3F4"
				title: "没坏处？成交，我买了。"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6>Forge 专属修饰器</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.5d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5EF0A002C1D2E3F4"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>重新开始</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>净化石</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>放入右侧栏位，而不是重铸材料。它会完全移除物品上的重铸效果，让你得到完全干净的装备。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在中间放一个</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>钻石</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，左右各放两个</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>紫水晶碎片</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，上下各放两个</grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>石头</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>即可合成。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"[!warn] 说实话，你很少会需要这个。用新材料覆盖旧修饰符就已经能替换它了，而且至少这样你还能获得一个新加成。净化则只会让你一无所有。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>由于它会丢弃你已付费的工作，按钮会要求你确认两次。先点击一次，然后在五秒内再次点击以确认。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "tiered:cleansing_stone"
			id: "5EF0A014C1D2E3F4"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "5EF0D014C1D2E3F4"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#9BB7D4 to=#9BB7D4>当你想要重新开始的时候。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5EF0B014C1D2E3F4"
				item: "tiered:cleansing_stone"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6>净化石</grad></shadow>"
			x: -3.0d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5EF0A013C1D2E3F4"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#C3FAFF to=#8AD8FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>完美的系统</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每次重铸都有极小概率获得 </grad><grad from=#C3FAFF to=#8AD8FF f=0.8>完美</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>结果。完美重铸会 </grad><grad from=#C3FAFF to=#8AD8FF f=0.8>移除所有惩罚效果，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>同时保留所有增益效果。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>发生的那一刻，你便会知晓。桌子会发出清脆的声响，并迸发出雪花，此后物品的提示框将保留着冰蓝色的边框。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>套装加成</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>使用同一修饰符的完整盔甲套装，可在其他效果之上额外获得 </grad><grad from=#5AB9FF to=#5096FF f=0.8>20%的套装加成</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。如果四件装备恰好都是 </grad><grad from=#C3FAFF to=#8AD8FF f=0.8>完美</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的，该加成将直接提升至 </grad><grad from=#C3FAFF to=#8AD8FF f=0.8>100%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!success] 完美从来都不是可以输一辈子的彩票。下一个任务会解释你为何注定能成功。"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "ftbquests:custom_icon"
				tag: {
					Icon: "tiered:textures/gui/perfect_star.png"
				}
			}
			icon_scale: 1.15d
			id: "5EF0A015C1D2E3F4"
			rewards: [{
				id: "5EF0D015C1D2E3F4"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 25
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<neon p=6 r=1 a=0.08><grad from=#C3FAFF to=#8AD8FF f=0.6>任何投掷能得到的最佳结果。</grad></neon>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5EF0B015C1D2E3F4"
